{"seq":1,"slug":"split-splitsource-scheduling-affinity-model","title":"Split/SplitSource 模型与 Node、Task 亲和的 Split 调度策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/trino-presto-distributed-federated-query-engine/split-scheduling-exchange-fault-tolerance/split-splitsource-scheduling-affinity-model","wordCount":2337,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"split-splitsource-模型与-node-task-亲和的-split-调度策略\">Split/SplitSource 模型与 Node、Task 亲和的 Split 调度策略</h1><p>一个 <code>SELECT count(*) FROM iceberg.orders WHERE dt = &#39;2026-07-01&#39;</code> 被编译成一棵 stage 树之后，真正决定它跑得快还是慢的，往往不是算子算法，而是<strong>这次扫描被切成了多少个 Split、每个 Split 落到哪台 worker、以及同一台 worker 上同时压着多少待处理 Split</strong>。Trino 与 Presto 都把「切分」与「落点」拆成两个独立扩展点：连接器产出 Split，调度器决定它去哪。理解这两者的契约，是排查「小文件查询慢」「个别 worker 打满而其余空闲」「重跑后缓存全失效」这类问题的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Split</strong> 是数据集的分片，是调度的最小单位；<strong>Task</strong> 是 worker 上执行某个 stage 的工作单元，消费 Split；<strong>SplitSource</strong> 是连接器给出 Split 的方式——不是一次性返回，而是分批拉取（来源：trino.io/docs/current/overview/concepts.html）。</p>\n<p>四层职责必须分清，否则调优时会改错层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>所在层</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>不负责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ConnectorSplitManager</code></td>\n<td>连接器 SPI</td>\n<td>把表切成 Split，返回 <code>ConnectorSplitSource</code></td>\n<td>不知道集群有哪些 worker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ConnectorSplitSource</code></td>\n<td>连接器 SPI</td>\n<td>分批产出 Split，响应动态过滤</td>\n<td>不做落点决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NodeSelector</code></td>\n<td>coordinator 引擎</td>\n<td>为每个 Split 挑选 worker</td>\n<td>不知道文件怎么切</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SourcePartitionedScheduler</code></td>\n<td>coordinator 引擎</td>\n<td>驱动 SplitSource 拉取 → 交给 NodeSelector → 下发 Task</td>\n<td>不解析连接器语义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>由此得到一条重要纪律：<strong>Split 的粒度由连接器决定，落点由引擎决定</strong>。Hive 连接器枚举分区里的文件，一个文件产出一个或多个 Split；对非分区数据源，官方推荐的简单做法是整张表暴露成<strong>一个</strong> Split（来源：trino.io/docs/current/develop/connectors.html）。这就是为什么表格式与连接器实现直接决定并行度上限——引擎再聪明也无法把一个 Split 拆成两个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[ConnectorSplitManager.getSplits] --&gt; B[ConnectorSplitSource]&#10;  B --&gt; C{getNextBatch&lt;br/&gt;maxSize + 动态过滤快照}&#10;  C --&gt;|未完成| D[Split 批次]&#10;  C --&gt;|isFinished| E[关闭 SplitSource]&#10;  D --&gt; F[NodeSelector.computeAssignments]&#10;  F --&gt; G{亲和性判定}&#10;  G --&gt;|本地可调度| H[优先本地 worker]&#10;  G --&gt;|远程可调度| I[minCandidates 随机集]&#10;  H --&gt; J[SplitWeight 加权选点]&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[RemoteTask 队列 → worker 执行 Driver]\">flowchart TD\n  A[ConnectorSplitManager.getSplits] --&gt; B[ConnectorSplitSource]\n  B --&gt; C{getNextBatch&lt;br/&gt;maxSize + 动态过滤快照}\n  C --&gt;|未完成| D[Split 批次]\n  C --&gt;|isFinished| E[关闭 SplitSource]\n  D --&gt; F[NodeSelector.computeAssignments]\n  F --&gt; G{亲和性判定}\n  G --&gt;|本地可调度| H[优先本地 worker]\n  G --&gt;|远程可调度| I[minCandidates 随机集]\n  H --&gt; J[SplitWeight 加权选点]\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[RemoteTask 队列 → worker 执行 Driver]</pre><h2 id=\"splitsource-的分批拉取与动态过滤\">SplitSource 的分批拉取与动态过滤</h2><p><code>ConnectorSplitSource</code> 继承 <code>Closeable</code>，核心签名是 <code>CompletableFuture&lt;List&lt;ConnectorSplit&gt;&gt; getNextBatch(int maxSize, DynamicFilterSnapshot dynamicFilterSnapshot)</code>，配合 <code>isFinished()</code> 与 <code>close()</code>（来源：Trino SPI <code>ConnectorSplitSource.java</code>）。三个设计要点：<strong>批次而非全量</strong>——<code>maxSize</code> 由引擎给出，连接器可返回更少甚至空批，但几次之后 <code>isFinished()</code> 必须为真，避免在元数据巨大的 Iceberg 表上一次列出几十万个 Split 撑爆 coordinator 堆；<strong>异步契约</strong>——返回 <code>CompletableFuture</code>，让元数据列举走异步 IO 而不阻塞调度线程；<strong>动态过滤下推</strong>——<code>DynamicFilterSnapshot</code> 把下游 stage 的过滤条件实时回传上游扫描，<code>ConnectorSplitManager</code> 另有静态参数 <code>Set&lt;ColumnHandle&gt; dynamicFilterColumns</code> 供规划期决定读哪些列的统计信息（来源：同 SPI）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"亲和性建模的两条路线\">亲和性建模的两条路线</h2><p>「这个 Split 能不能跑到任意一台 worker 上」是调度策略的分岔点，Trino 与 Presto 用了两套 SPI 表达同一件事。</p>\n<p><strong>Trino 路线：远程可达性 + 亲和键。</strong> <code>ConnectorSplit</code> 的三个默认方法构成契约：<code>isRemotelyAccessible()</code> 默认返回 <code>true</code>，此时 <code>getAddresses()</code> 只被当作<strong>调度提示</strong>；一旦覆写为 <code>false</code>，Split <strong>只能</strong>落在 <code>getAddresses()</code> 返回的地址之一。第三个是 <code>getAffinityKey()</code>，返回可选字符串，把读取相关内容的 Split 跨查询路由到同一批 worker（来源：Trino SPI <code>ConnectorSplit.java</code>）。其 Javadoc 有强约束：<strong>只有远程可访问的 Split 才能提供亲和键</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>Presto 路线：显式策略枚举。</strong> <code>ConnectorSplit.getNodeSelectionStrategy()</code> 返回 <code>NodeSelectionStrategy</code>，取值 <code>HARD_AFFINITY(0)</code>、<code>SOFT_AFFINITY(1)</code>、<code>NO_PREFERENCE(2)</code>；配套 <code>getPreferredNodes(NodeProvider)</code> 返回优先节点列表（来源：prestodb/presto SPI 同名文件）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Trino</th>\n<th>Presto</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强制本地</td>\n<td><code>isRemotelyAccessible() = false</code></td>\n<td><code>HARD_AFFINITY</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软偏好</td>\n<td><code>getAddresses()</code> + <code>optimized-local-scheduling</code></td>\n<td><code>SOFT_AFFINITY</code> + <code>getPreferredNodes</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无偏好</td>\n<td>默认（<code>getAddresses()</code> 为空）</td>\n<td><code>NO_PREFERENCE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨查询亲和</td>\n<td><code>getAffinityKey()</code>（字符串，走稳定哈希）</td>\n<td>无等价内置机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td>亲和键标注 <code>@JsonIgnore</code>，不随 Split 下发</td>\n<td>策略枚举随 Split 序列化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Trino 的亲和键<strong>不序列化到 worker</strong>——Hive 与 Iceberg 的 Split 都把它标成 <code>@JsonIgnore</code>，因为「它只在 coordinator 的调度器上使用」（来源：Trino <code>HiveSplit.java</code>、<code>IcebergSplit.java</code>）。这是刻意裁剪：亲和性是调度期概念，worker 不需要知道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"splitweight-加权选点与-nodeselector-算法\">SplitWeight 加权选点与 NodeSelector 算法</h2><p>Split 不是等价的。1GB 的 Parquet 文件与 4MB 的小文件被当成同权重调度，会直接制造长尾。<code>SplitWeight</code> 就是修这个问题的：内部用 <code>UNIT_VALUE = 100</code> 的定点整数表示标准权重（来源：Trino <code>io.trino.spi.SplitWeight</code>）。Hive 的 <code>SizeBasedSplitWeightProvider</code> 给出可直接照抄的换算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1.0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = \\mathrm{clamp}\\!\\left(\\frac{s_i}{s_{\\text{target}}},\\ w_{\\min},\\ 1.0\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 Split 字节数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{target}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目标 Split 大小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是下界（来源：Trino <code>SizeBasedSplitWeightProvider.java</code>）。clamp 上界锁在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着<strong>大文件不会被赋予超过一个标准 Split 的权重</strong>；切分本身仍靠 <code>target-split-size</code> 完成。</p>\n<p><code>UniformNodeSelector.computeAssignments</code> 是选点主循环，可概括成三步（来源：Trino <code>UniformNodeSelector.java</code>）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>候选集构造</strong>。若 Split 不可远程访问，候选集是 <code>selectExactNodes(getAddresses())</code>；若可远程访问且有首选地址（亲和键经 <code>StableHostAddressProvider</code> 解析，或直接用 <code>getAddresses()</code>）且开启了 <code>optimized-local-scheduling</code>，则先精确匹配首选节点，<strong>匹配失败才回退</strong>到 <code>selectNodes(minCandidates, ...)</code> 随机候选集。</li>\n<li><strong>选点</strong>。挑加权队列最轻的节点。<code>chooseNodeForSplit</code> 按 <code>splits-balancing-policy</code> 分两种口径：<code>STAGE</code> 看该节点<strong>本 stage</strong> 排队权重，<code>NODE</code> 看节点<strong>全局</strong>总权重（来源：<code>NodeSchedulerConfig.SplitsBalancingPolicy</code>，默认 <code>STAGE</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>阻塞回退</strong>。没有节点可放时候选节点被标为 blocked；若全是「等待任意节点」的软偏好 Split，返回「等某台 worker 队列降到低水位」的 future，而不是空转。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>低水位与待处理量由三个参数共同约束：<code>min-pending-splits-per-task</code>（默认 16）保证每 Task 至少排到这么多标准权重，防饥饿；<code>max-adjusted-pending-splits-per-task</code>（默认 2000）是仅 <code>uniform</code> 策略生效的动态上界；<code>max-unacknowledged-splits-per-task</code>（默认 2000）限制「coordinator 已排队但 worker 尚未确认」的 Split 数，优先级最高，防止单次 task update 请求过大（来源：trino.io/docs/current/admin/properties-node-scheduler.html）。</p>\n<p><code>node-scheduler.min-candidates</code>（默认 10）控制随机候选集规模：太小损害均衡，太大增加延迟与 coordinator CPU 开销。网络拓扑感知是另一条路径：<code>node-scheduler.policy</code> 设为 <code>topology</code>（旧名 <code>flat</code>），调度器便按网络距离而非随机放置 Split（来源：<code>NodeSchedulerConfig.toNodeSchedulerPolicy</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稳定亲和-从缓存键到-rendezvous-哈希\">稳定亲和：从缓存键到 Rendezvous 哈希</h2><p>亲和键的价值在于<strong>跨查询复用 worker 端缓存</strong>。Hive 与 Iceberg 的 Split 都携带亲和键，典型取值是文件路径一类的缓存标识；同一文件在后续查询中被再次扫描时，若它稳定落到同一台 worker，parquet 元数据缓存、ORC stripe 缓存乃至文件系统页缓存都能命中。</p>\n<p>实现这件事的是 <code>StableHostAddressProvider</code>：把 Split 的缓存键映射到一组<strong>稳定的</strong> worker 地址，算法是 rendezvous 哈希——对每个 worker 计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mn>64</mn></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>key</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i = \\mathrm{murmur3}\\big(\\mathrm{hash}(n_i) \\oplus \\mathrm{XxHash64}(\\text{key})\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">murmur3</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">XxHash64</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">key</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取权重最高的前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个 worker；节点成员变化时，<strong>只有落在受影响节点上的键会被重新分配</strong>（来源：Trino <code>StableHostAddressProvider.java</code>）。这个「最小重分配」性质是 rendezvous 相对取模哈希的核心优势：扩缩容不会让全部缓存失效。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 由 <code>node-scheduler.cache-preferred-hosts-count</code> 配置，<strong>默认 2</strong>——给两个候选，是为了首选节点繁忙时仍有一个不牺牲缓存局部性的备选。</p>\n<p>实现里还有一处值得学的性能取舍：用<strong>有界插入</strong>在一次无分配遍历里维护 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 列表，而不是先排序再取前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，因为排序会对<strong>每个 Split</strong> 排序全部节点并分配内存。在每秒数万 Split 的集群里，这个常数因子就是 coordinator 的 CPU 天花板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数调优与四个典型失效模式\">参数调优与四个典型失效模式</h2><p>调参前先确认参数控制的是哪一层。<code>node-scheduler.max-splits-per-node</code>（默认 256）是每 worker 并发标准权重 Split 上限，过高浪费内存且降低均衡；<code>include-coordinator</code>（默认 true）在大集群上开启会让协调被查询处理拖垮。</p>\n<p><strong>失效模式一：小文件风暴。</strong> 表里几百万个小文件时，Split 数远超 <code>max-splits-per-node</code>，调度器大部分时间在「返回低水位 future → 唤醒 → 再试」之间循环。对策不是调大上限，而是在写入侧用 <code>target-split-size</code> 与文件合并把 Split 数量压下来。</p>\n<p><strong>失效模式二：单点热点。</strong> 若连接器把 <code>isRemotelyAccessible()</code> 误设为 <code>false</code>（例如 Hive 的 <code>force-local-scheduling</code>），Split 被硬钉在少数节点上，<code>minCandidates</code> 根本不起作用——看各 worker 的 <code>queuedSplitsWeight</code> 分布是否长尾即可识别。</p>\n<p><strong>失效模式三：硬亲和打不满。</strong> 硬性任务要求（如必须落到暴露特定 catalog 的节点）无法满足时，调度器会等到 <code>allowed-no-matching-node-period</code> 超时才失败。它是兜底闸门，不是调度优化手段。</p>\n<p><strong>失效模式四：缓存命中率骤降。</strong> 若亲和键映射用取模而非 rendezvous 哈希，扩缩容会让缓存整体失效；用 stable provider + 默认 <code>cache-preferred-hosts-count = 2</code> 可避免。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Split 切分归连接器，落点归引擎；<strong>并行度上限由连接器的 Split 粒度决定</strong>，引擎无法凭空扩大它。</li>\n<li><code>ConnectorSplitSource</code> 用 <code>getNextBatch(maxSize, dynamicFilterSnapshot)</code> + <code>isFinished()</code> 表达「分批 + 可下推」；动态过滤分静态列集与每批快照两条通道。</li>\n<li>亲和性有两条 SPI 路线：Trino 用 <code>isRemotelyAccessible()</code> / <code>getAddresses()</code> / <code>getAffinityKey()</code>（亲和键不序列化），Presto 用 <code>NodeSelectionStrategy</code> 三值枚举 + <code>getPreferredNodes()</code>。</li>\n<li><code>SplitWeight</code> 把「Split 不等价」编码进调度：内部是 <code>UNIT_VALUE = 100</code> 的定点数，Hive 按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = \\mathrm{clamp}(s_i / s_{\\text{target}}, w_{\\min}, 1.0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 换算；<code>UniformNodeSelector</code> 据此挑最轻加权队列，均衡口径由 <code>splits-balancing-policy</code> 在 <code>STAGE</code> 与 <code>NODE</code> 间选择。</li>\n<li><code>StableHostAddressProvider</code> 用 rendezvous 哈希把缓存键稳定映射到 worker，最小化扩缩容引起的缓存失效；有界插入是为 coordinator CPU 做的刻意优化。</li>\n<li>小文件风暴、单点热点、硬亲和打不满、缓存命中骤降四个失效模式各自对应不同的层，调参前先确认自己在改哪一层。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SPI 签名与配置默认值取自 Trino 官方文档与 <code>trinodb/trino</code>、<code>prestodb/presto</code> 源码；Trino 最新发布版本为 483（2026 年 7 月 17 日）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Split/SplitSource 模型与 Node、Task 亲和的 Split 调度策略","id":"split-splitsource-模型与-node-task-亲和的-split-调度策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SplitSource 的分批拉取与动态过滤","id":"splitsource-的分批拉取与动态过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"亲和性建模的两条路线","id":"亲和性建模的两条路线"},{"level":2,"text":"SplitWeight 加权选点与 NodeSelector 算法","id":"splitweight-加权选点与-nodeselector-算法"},{"level":2,"text":"稳定亲和：从缓存键到 Rendezvous 哈希","id":"稳定亲和-从缓存键到-rendezvous-哈希"},{"level":2,"text":"参数调优与四个典型失效模式","id":"参数调优与四个典型失效模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"会话属性、事务语义与内存池/查询队列的运行时管控实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/trino-presto-distributed-federated-query-engine/mpp-architecture-query-lifecycle/session-property-transaction-memory-pool"},"next":{"title":"Exchange 数据交换：分区输出缓冲、序列化传输与反压控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/trino-presto-distributed-federated-query-engine/split-scheduling-exchange-fault-tolerance/exchange-shuffle-buffer-backpressure"}}